    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap Native IGMPv2 Protocol Engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Specifications:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RFC 2236 Internet Group Management Protocol, Version 2</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>IP Protocol Number: 2</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Zero dynamic memory allocation (0 bytes heap)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Types:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>0x11: Membership Query</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>0x16: IGMPv2 Membership Report (Join)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>0x17: IGMPv2 Leave Group </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
